{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Memory 压缩与总结技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细说明 Agent 系统中记忆压缩的必要性、常用技术、分层摘要的实现方法，以及如何在压缩率和信息保留之间做权衡。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>为什么需要记忆压缩</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>上下文窗口限制</strong>：LLM 的上下文有长度上限（4K-200K 不等），过长上下文会导致\"上下文腐烂\"（无关信息稀释注意力）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>成本问题</strong>：长上下文意味着更多的 token 消耗和更高的 API 费用</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>检索效率</strong>：压缩后的记忆更容易检索和匹配</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>存储效率</strong>：减少长期存储的体积</li>\n</ol>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>常用压缩技术</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>滑动窗口（Sliding Window）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">只保留最近 N 轮对话，更早的直接丢弃</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">实现简单，但会丢失所有长期信息</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">变体：\"重要窗口\"——保留最近 N 条 + 几个全局重要记忆</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>摘要式压缩（Summarization）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">每隔 N 轮对话，让 LLM 把之前的对话总结成一段短文本</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">改进版：<strong>分层摘要</strong>——每小时总结一次，每天再把小时摘要再总结</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>重要性评分 + 筛选</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">每条记忆打分（0-1），低于阈值的丢弃</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">评分维度：信息独特性、对后续决策的影响、用户显式强调</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>结构化提取</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">从对话中提取 (实体, 关系, 时间) 三元组</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">存到图数据库中，比原始文本短得多且便于推理</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>向量压缩</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">用专门的压缩模型（如 AutoCompressors）把长上下文压缩成虚拟 token</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HierarchicalSummarizer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"分层摘要器：实现金字塔式摘要\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> window_size<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>window_size <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> window_size\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 三层摘要</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 原始对话缓冲（10轮）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 小时级摘要</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level3_summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 天级总摘要</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_dialogue</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> agent_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"添加对话\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"User: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>user_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\\nAgent: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>agent_msg<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L1 缓冲满，生成 L2 摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>window_size<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_l2_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_generate_l2_summary</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成小时级摘要\"\"\"</span>\n        content <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"将以下对话总结为简洁的摘要，保留关键信息、用户偏好和重要决策：\n\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n摘要（不超过100字）：\"\"\"</span></span>\n        \n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">150</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"turns\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L2 摘要数量达到阈值，生成 L3 摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 6 个 L2 摘要 → L3</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_generate_l3_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_generate_l3_summary</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生成天级摘要\"\"\"</span>\n        content <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>s<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> s <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"基于以下会话摘要，提取用户的长期偏好、重要事实和关键模式：\n\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n长期画像（实体-关系格式）：\"\"\"</span></span>\n        \n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level3_summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">300</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clear<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_compressed_context</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取压缩后的上下文\"\"\"</span>\n        parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 最高层摘要（最重要）</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level3_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[长期画像] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level3_summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 中层摘要</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> s <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level2_summaries<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[会话摘要] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>s<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'content'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 最新原始对话（最详细）</span>\n        parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>level1_buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>遗忘曲线模型</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">模拟人类艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线，记忆的\"存活概率\"随时间衰减：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ForgettingCurveMemory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于遗忘曲线的记忆管理\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> half_life_days<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">14</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>half_life <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> half_life_days  <span class=\"token comment\"># 半衰期（天）</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compute_recall_probability</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算记忆的回忆概率\"\"\"</span>\n        age_days <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"created\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">86400</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 艾宾浩斯公式: R = e^(-t/S)</span>\n        recall_prob <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>exp<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span>age_days <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>half_life<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 访问次数提升概率</span>\n        access_boost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"access_count\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 重要性加成</span>\n        importance_boost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"importance\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">min</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recall_prob <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> access_boost <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> importance_boost<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">should_retain</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断记忆是否应该保留\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>compute_recall_probability<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 阈值</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">cleanup</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"清理低价值记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memories <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>m <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> m <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memories <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>should_retain<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>m<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>压缩策略的权衡</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>信息保留</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单层摘要</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分层摘要</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化提取</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>向量压缩</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：分层摘要的层次怎么确定？答：根据业务场景决定，一般 2-3 层足够。对话密集型用对话级→会话级→用户级。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：摘要本身越来越长怎么办？答：对摘要也做摘要（递归摘要），或者对摘要做结构化提取。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：如何保证压缩不丢失关键信息？答：关键信息做标记（如用户明确确认的事实），标记的信息不压缩或单独存储。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：压缩率越高越好。过度压缩会丢失关键上下文。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：所有信息用同一种压缩方式。不同重要性的信息应该用不同的压缩策略。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：压缩是一次性的。实际上压缩应该是持续的、分层的过程。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}